        .chat-area { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }
        .messages-container { padding: 12px; overflow-y: auto; flex: 1; max-height: calc(100vh - 112px); scroll-behavior: smooth; overscroll-behavior: contain; }

        .welcome-screen { text-align: center; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 36px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 100%; animation: fadeIn 0.8s var(--transition-curve); }
        @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
        .welcome-title { font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary)); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        .welcome-subtitle { font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
        .start-btn { padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 0.95rem; min-height: 44px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.18), rgba(255,255,255,0.10));
            border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-md); color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s var(--transition-curve); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); }
        .start-btn:hover { border-color: var(--border-glow); transform: translateY(-1px); }

        .message { margin-bottom: 20px; animation: messageSlideIn 0.4s var(--transition-curve); user-select: none; -webkit-user-select: none; }
        @keyframes messageSlideIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(15px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }

        .user-message { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; }
        .user-bubble { color: #fff; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: var(--radius-lg) var(--radius-lg) var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-lg); max-width: 80%; font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary)); cursor: pointer; }
        .user-bubble:active { filter: brightness(1.1); }

        .ai-message { display: flex; flex-direction: column; max-width: 90%; }
        .ai-bubble { background: var(--glass-strong); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg) var(--radius-lg) var(--radius-lg) var(--radius-sm); padding: 10px 14px; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 0.95rem; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
        .ai-bubble pre { background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 10px; margin: 10px 0; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 0.88em; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word; position: relative; overflow: auto; max-height: 340px; }
        .ai-bubble code { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding: 2px 5px; border-radius: 4px; }
        .ai-bubble pre > code { background-color: transparent; padding: 0; }
        .copy-code-btn { position: absolute; top: 6px; right: 6px; background: var(--glass-strong); border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text-muted); padding: 3px 7px; border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.75em; transition: all 0.2s; opacity: 0.8; }
        .copy-code-btn:hover { background: var(--primary); color: white; border-color: var(--primary); }

        /* Keresés/állapot chip */
        .search-status { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 8px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; animation: fadeIn 0.5s; align-self:flex-start; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border:1px solid var(--border); padding:6px 10px; border-radius:999px; }

        /* Források: kártyás linkek */
        .sources-container { margin-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: 8px; }
        .sources-title { font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .source-link { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--primary); text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; margin-bottom: 6px; transition: color 0.2s; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); padding: 6px 8px; border-radius: 8px; }
        .source-link:hover { color: var(--secondary); }
        .source-link img { width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 4px; opacity: 0.9; }

        /* Másolás overlay */
        #copyOverlay { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100vw; height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px); z-index: 200; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; transition: opacity 0.3s var(--transition-curve); }
        #copyOverlay.visible { opacity: 1; pointer-events: all; }
        #copyBtn { padding: 16px 32px; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.18), rgba(255,255,255,0.10)); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); border-radius: var(--radius-md); backdrop-filter: blur(15px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(15px); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4); cursor: pointer; transform: scale(0.96); transition: transform 0.25s var(--transition-curve), background-color 0.2s; min-height: 48px; min-width: 140px; }
        #copyOverlay.visible #copyBtn { transform: scale(1); }
        #copyBtn:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25); }
        #copyBtn:active { transform: scale(0.98); }

        /* Input area */
        .input-area { padding: 8px 12px; background: rgba(5, 2, 10, 0.6); backdrop-filter: blur(30px) saturate(150%); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); position: sticky; bottom: 0; z-index: 50; flex-shrink: 0; }
        @supports (padding: max(0px)) { .input-area { padding-bottom: max(8px, env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); } }
        .input-wrapper { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: flex-end; }
        .message-input { flex: 1; background: var(--glass-strong); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 20px; padding: 10px 14px; color: var(--text); font-size: 0.95rem; resize: none; outline: none; transition: all 0.2s var(--transition-curve); min-height: 40px; max-height: 140px; font-family: inherit; line-height: 1.5; }
        .message-input::placeholder { color: #9aa3af; }
        .message-input:focus { border-color: var(--primary); box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary) 60%, transparent); }

        .send-btn-container { width: 40px; height: 40px; flex-shrink: 0; }
        .send-btn { width: 100%; height: 100%; border-radius: 50%; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: none; background: var(--primary); color: white; transition: all 0.2s var(--transition-curve); font-size: 0.9rem; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); }
        .send-btn:disabled { background: var(--glass-strong); color: var(--text-muted); cursor: not-allowed; box-shadow: none; }
        .send-btn:not(:disabled):hover { transform: scale(1.08); box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--primary); }
        .send-btn:not(:disabled):active { transform: scale(0.96); }

        /* Globális fókusz (WCAG 2.4.7, 2.4.13 ajánlások) */
        :focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #0A61F7; outline-offset: 2px; } /* látható, 3:1+ kontraszt sötét háttéren[5][15][18] */
        .header-btn:focus-visible, .start-btn:focus-visible, .send-btn:focus-visible, .message-input:focus-visible, .source-link:focus-visible, #copyBtn:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #0A61F7; outline-offset: 2px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="aurora-background"> <div class="aurora one"></div> <div class="aurora two"></div> </div>
    <div class="container">
        <header class="header">
            <button class="header-btn" id="newChatBtn" title="Új beszélgetés" aria-label="Új beszélgetés"> <i class="fas fa-plus"></i> </button>
            <h1 class="header-title" aria-label="JadedLight alkalmazás címe">JadedLight</h1>
            <div style="width: 36px;" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </header>
        <div class="chat-area">
            <section class="messages-container" id="messagesContainer" aria-live="polite">
                <header class="welcome-screen" id="welcomeScreen">
                    <h2 class="welcome-title">JadedLight</h2>
                    <p class="welcome-subtitle">Autonóm AI asszisztens webkereséssel.</p>
                    <button class="start-btn" onclick="hideWelcome()"> <i class="fas fa-rocket"></i> Kezdjük! </button>
                </header>
            </section>
            <footer class="input-area">
                <div class="input-wrapper">
                    <textarea class="message-input" id="messageInput" placeholder="Írj egy üzenetet… (tipp: használd a / parancsokat)" rows="1" aria-label="Üzenet beviteli mező"></textarea>
                    <div class="send-btn-container">
                        <button class="send-btn" id="sendBtn" onclick="sendMessage()" aria-label="Üzenet küldése" disabled> <i class="fas fa-paper-plane"></i> </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </footer>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="copyOverlay" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Másolás">
        <button id="copyBtn"><i class="far fa-copy"></i> Másolás</button>
    </div>

    <script>
        const AppState = { isTyping: false, userId: 'user_' + Math.random().toString(36).substr(2, 9) };
        const API_BASE_URL = '/api';
        const messagesContainer = document.getElementById('messagesContainer');
        const messageInput = document.getElementById('messageInput');
        const sendBtn = document.getElementById('sendBtn');
        const newChatBtn = document.getElementById('newChatBtn');
        const copyOverlay = document.getElementById('copyOverlay');
        const copyBtn = document.getElementById('copyBtn');
        let welcomeScreen = document.getElementById('welcomeScreen');

        class DynamicThemeManager {
            constructor() {
                this.root = document.documentElement;
                this.auroraBlobs = document.querySelectorAll('.aurora');
                this.colorPairs = [
                    {primary: '#39FF14', secondary: '#0A61F7'},
                    {primary: '#0A61F7', secondary: '#39FF14'},
                    {primary: '#39FF14', secondary: '#00FFFF'}
                ];
                this.currentIndex = 0;
                this.updateColors(this.colorPairs[0]);
                setInterval(() => this.cyclePalette(), 90000);
                setTimeout(() => this.auroraBlobs.forEach(b => b.classList.add('visible')), 500);
            }
            updateColors(pair) {
                const primaryRGB = this.hexToRgb(pair.primary).join(',');
                this.root.style.setProperty('--primary', pair.primary);
                this.root.style.setProperty('--secondary', pair.secondary);
                this.root.style.setProperty('--border-glow', `rgba(${primaryRGB}, 0.5)`);
                this.auroraBlobs.forEach((blob, i) => {
                    blob.style.backgroundColor = i % 2 === 0 ? pair.primary : pair.secondary;
                });
            }
            hexToRgb(hex) {
                let r = 0, g = 0, b = 0;
                if (hex.length == 7) {
                    r = parseInt(hex.substring(1, 3), 16);
                    g = parseInt(hex.substring(3, 5), 16);
                    b = parseInt(hex.substring(5, 7), 16);
                }
                return [r, g, b];
            }
            cyclePalette = () => {
                this.currentIndex = (this.currentIndex + 1) % this.colorPairs.length;
                this.updateColors(this.colorPairs[this.currentIndex]);
            }
        }

        function hideWelcome() {
            if (welcomeScreen) {
                welcomeScreen.style.animation = 'fadeOut 0.5s forwards';
                setTimeout(() => {
                    if (welcomeScreen) welcomeScreen.style.display = 'none';
                    welcomeScreen = null;
                }, 500);
            }
        }

        function newChat() {
            messagesContainer.innerHTML = '';
            const newWelcome = document.createElement('header');
            newWelcome.className = 'welcome-screen';
            newWelcome.id = 'welcomeScreen';
            newWelcome.innerHTML = `
                <h2 class="welcome-title">JadedLight</h2>
                <p class="welcome-subtitle">Autonóm AI asszisztens webkereséssel.</p>
                <button class="start-btn" onclick="hideWelcome()"><i class="fas fa-rocket"></i> Kezdjük!</button>`;
            messagesContainer.appendChild(newWelcome);
            welcomeScreen = newWelcome;
            messageInput.value = '';
            messageInput.dispatchEvent(new Event('input'));
        }

        async function sendMessage() {
            const message = messageInput.value.trim();
            if (!message || AppState.isTyping) return;
            hideWelcome();
            addUserMessage(message);
            messageInput.value = '';
            messageInput.dispatchEvent(new Event('input'));
            AppState.isTyping = true;
            sendBtn.disabled = true;

            const aiBubble = createAiMessageContainer();
            messagesContainer.appendChild(aiBubble.container);
            scrollToBottom();

            try {
                const response = await fetch(\`\${API_BASE_URL}/chat\`, {
                    method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
                    body: JSON.stringify({ message, user_id: AppState.userId })
                });
                if (!response.ok) throw new Error(\`Szerverhiba: \${response.status}\`);
                await streamResponseToBubble(response, aiBubble);
            } catch (error) {
                aiBubble.content.innerHTML += \`<p style="color: #ff5555;"><strong>Hiba:</strong> \${escapeHtml(error.message)}</p>\`;
            } finally {
                AppState.isTyping = false;
                sendBtn.disabled = messageInput.value.trim().length === 0;
            }
        }

        // Stream + meta üzenetek + kíméletes auto-scroll
        async function streamResponseToBubble(response, bubbleElements) {
            const { container, content, status } = bubbleElements;
            const reader = response.body.getReader();
            const decoder = new TextDecoder();
            let buffer = '';
            let isRendering = false;

            // Auto-scroll csak ha a felhasználó a lista alján van
            let keepAutoscroll = true;
            const nearBottom = () => messagesContainer.scrollTop + messagesContainer.clientHeight >= messagesContainer.scrollHeight - 24;
            const onScroll = () => { keepAutoscroll = nearBottom(); };
            messagesContainer.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll);

            let rafFlag = false;
            const render = () => {
                rafFlag = false;

                // Meta state-k
                if (buffer.includes('[SEARCHING_WEB]')) {
                    status.innerHTML = `<i class="fas fa-globe fa-spin"></i> Keresés a weben...`;
                    if (!status.isConnected) container.insertBefore(status, content);
                    buffer = buffer.replace('[SEARCHING_WEB]\n', '');
                }
                if (buffer.includes('[SOURCES:')) {
                    const sourcesMatch = buffer.match(/\[SOURCES:(.*?)\]\n/);
                    if (sourcesMatch) {
                        const urls = sourcesMatch[1].split(',');
                        displaySources(container, urls);
                        buffer = buffer.replace(sourcesMatch[0], '');
                    }
                }

                // Diff-alapú frissítés
                content.setAttribute('role','article');
                content.setAttribute('aria-label','AI válasz');
                content.innerHTML = simpleMarkdown(buffer);

                if (keepAutoscroll) {
                    messagesContainer.scrollTop = messagesContainer.scrollHeight;
                }
            };

            const startRendering = () => {
                if (isRendering) return;
                isRendering = true;
            };

            const scheduleRender = () => {
                if (rafFlag) return;
                rafFlag = true;
                requestAnimationFrame(render);
            };

            const stopRendering = () => {
                isRendering = false;
                content.innerHTML = simpleMarkdown(buffer); // végső render
                addCopyButtonsToCode(content);
                addLongPressCopy(content);
                if (status && status.parentNode) status.remove();
                messagesContainer.removeEventListener('scroll', onScroll);
                if (nearBottom()) scrollToBottom();
            };

            startRendering();

            while (true) {
                const { value, done } = await reader.read();
                if (done) { stopRendering(); break; }
                buffer += decoder.decode(value, { stream: true });
                scheduleRender();
            }
        }

        // Források: favicon + domain
        function displaySources(messageContainer, urls) {
            let sourcesDiv = messageContainer.querySelector('.sources-container');
            if (!sourcesDiv) {
                sourcesDiv = document.createElement('div');
                sourcesDiv.className = 'sources-container';
                sourcesDiv.setAttribute('role','list');
                const title = document.createElement('div');
                title.className = 'sources-title';
                title.textContent = 'Források';
                sourcesDiv.appendChild(title);
                messageContainer.appendChild(sourcesDiv);
            }
            const html = urls.map(url => {
                try {
                    const host = new URL(url).hostname;
                    const ico = ``;
                    return `
                                <img src="${ico}" alt="" aria-hidden="true" /> ${host}
                            `;
                } catch {
                    return `${escapeHtml(url)}`;
                }
            }).join('');
            sourcesDiv.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend', html);
        }

        function addUserMessage(message) {
            const messageDiv = document.createElement('div');
            messageDiv.className = 'message user-message';
            const bubble = document.createElement('div');
            bubble.className = 'user-bubble';
            bubble.textContent = message;
            messageDiv.appendChild(bubble);
            messagesContainer.appendChild(messageDiv);
            addLongPressCopy(bubble);
            scrollToBottom();
        }

        function createAiMessageContainer() {
            const container = document.createElement('div');
            container.className = 'message ai-message';
            const status = document.createElement('div');
            status.className = 'search-status';
            const content = document.createElement('div');
            content.className = 'ai-bubble';
            container.appendChild(content);
            return { container, content, status };
        }

        // Long-press copy
        function addLongPressCopy(element){
            let pressTimer=null;
            const start=(e)=>{ if(e.target.closest('pre'))return; pressTimer=setTimeout(()=>{
                navigator.vibrate?.(50);
                const textToCopy=element.innerText;
                copyBtn.dataset.text=textToCopy;
                copyBtn.innerHTML='<i class="far fa-copy"></i> Másolás';
                copyOverlay.classList.add('visible');
                copyBtn.focus();
            },500)};
            const cancel=()=>{ clearTimeout(pressTimer) };
            element.addEventListener("mousedown",start);
            element.addEventListener("touchstart",start,{passive:true});
            element.addEventListener("mouseup",cancel);
            element.addEventListener("mouseleave",cancel);
            element.addEventListener("touchend",cancel);
            element.addEventListener("touchcancel",cancel);
        }

        // Markdown egyszerűsített + link auto
        function simpleMarkdown(text){
            let html = escapeHtml(text)
                .replace(/\*\*(.*?)\*\*/g,'<strong>$1</strong>')
                .replace(/\*(.*?)\*/g,'<em>$1</em>')
                .replace(/``````/g,(match,lang,code)=>`<pre><code class="${lang||''}">${code}</code></pre>`)
                .replace(/`(.*?)`/g,'<code>$1</code>')
                .replace(/(https?:\/\/[^\s)]+)\b/g, '$1');
            return html;
        }

        function addCopyButtonsToCode(container){
            container.querySelectorAll('pre').forEach(pre=>{
                if(pre.querySelector('.copy-code-btn'))return;
                const btn=document.createElement('button');
                btn.className='copy-code-btn';
                btn.innerHTML='<i class="far fa-copy"></i>';
                btn.title='Kód másolása';
                btn.onclick=(e)=>{ e.stopPropagation(); const code=pre.querySelector('code').innerText; copyToClipboard(code,btn) };
                pre.appendChild(btn);
            });
        }

        function copyToClipboard(text,btnElement){
            const textArea=document.createElement('textarea');
            textArea.value=text; document.body.appendChild(textArea); textArea.select();
            try{
                document.execCommand('copy');
                if(btnElement){ btnElement.innerHTML='<i class="fas fa-check"></i>'; setTimeout(()=>{ btnElement.innerHTML='<i class="far fa-copy"></i>' },1200) }
                copyBtn.innerHTML='<i class="fas fa-check"></i> Másolva';
                setTimeout(()=>copyOverlay.classList.remove('visible'),700);
            }catch(err){
                if(btnElement) btnElement.innerHTML='<i class="fas fa-times"></i>';
            }
            document.body.removeChild(textArea);
        }

        function escapeHtml(text){
            const div=document.createElement('div'); div.textContent=String(text); return div.innerHTML;
        }

        function scrollToBottom(){ messagesContainer.scrollTo({ top: messagesContainer.scrollHeight, behavior: 'smooth' }) }

        function setupEventListeners(){
            messageInput.addEventListener('input',()=>{
                sendBtn.disabled = messageInput.value.trim().length===0 || AppState.isTyping;
                messageInput.style.height='auto';
                messageInput.style.height=`${Math.min(messageInput.scrollHeight,140)}px`;
                // parancs-súgó helykitöltő viselkedés
                if (messageInput.value.startsWith('/')) {
                    messageInput.placeholder = 'Parancsok: /web, /code, /summarize …';
                } else {
                    messageInput.placeholder = 'Írj egy üzenetet… (tipp: használd a / parancsokat)';
                }
            });
            messageInput.addEventListener('keydown',(e)=>{
                if(e.key==='Enter' && !e.shiftKey){
                    e.preventDefault();
                    if(!sendBtn.disabled) sendMessage();
                }
            });
            newChatBtn.addEventListener('click', newChat);
            copyOverlay.addEventListener('click', ()=> copyOverlay.classList.remove('visible'));
            copyBtn.addEventListener('click',(e)=>{
                e.stopPropagation();
                copyToClipboard(e.currentTarget.dataset.text, e.currentTarget);
            });
            document.addEventListener('keydown',(e)=>{ if(e.key==='Escape') copyOverlay.classList.remove('visible'); });
        }

        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',()=>{
            new DynamicThemeManager();
            setupEventListeners();
            messageInput.focus();
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

## 2) Mit javít ez?

- Olvashatóság és vizuális hierarchia: nagyobb alap betűméret, ritkább sor, erősebb hero cím, egységesített kerekítések és árnyékok. A spacing a 8pt logikát követi a ritmusért[7][8][9].
- Header elrendezés: grid-del valódi középre igazítás, nem csúszik el.
- AI buborék és kódblokkok: nagyobb kontraszt, modern monospace, max-height + scroll, másolás gomb.
- Források: domain kártyák favikonnal; a linkek target=_blank rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow".
- Auto-scroll teljesítmény: rAF ütemezés, csak ha a felhasználó „alul van”.
- Másolás overlay: taktilis animáció, automatikus visszazárás, ESC támogatás.
- Hozzáférhetőség: fókuszjelzők minden interaktív elemre (2px, jól látható, 3:1+), role/aria címkék a fő részekhez; ez a WCAG fókusz-előírásainak megfelel[1][2][3][4][5][6].
- Parancssáv-hint: dinamikus placeholder „/” esetén.

Ha szeretnél, készítek mellé egy mini design system táblát (színskála, tipó skála, komponens-állapotok), vagy átdolgozom a /api/chat stream meta-protokollját egységes “[SEARCHING_WEB] / [SOURCES:…]” helyett JSON-chunk alapúra.
